---
const { race } = Astro.props;
---

<section class="story" id="story">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="story-grid">
      <div class="reveal">
        <div class="kicker">Our Race</div>
        <h2>It started as a <em>school</em> fundraiser.</h2>
        <p>In 2012, a group of teachers and parents needed to raise $40,000 for a new elementary library. Someone suggested a road race. Eleven people signed up the first year.</p>
        <p>Fourteen years later, the Hartwell Hometown Half is one of New England's largest small-town races. Every dollar of profit still goes to the Hartwell Education Foundation. We've raised $420,000 for local schools.</p>
        <div class="story-quote">"We tell first-timers: you'll never run a friendlier race. The whole town shows up to cheer."</div>
        <div class="story-quote-byline">— Sarah Mendez, Race Director (2015–present)</div>
      </div>
      <div class="reveal">
        <div class="story-photo">
          <div class="ph-img ph-runners">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 400 500" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid slice" aria-hidden="true">
              <!-- soft golden hour wash -->
              <ellipse cx="200" cy="100" rx="240" ry="100" fill="#FFD79B" opacity=".4"/>
              <!-- distant trees -->
              <path d="M0 200 L60 175 L120 195 L180 170 L240 190 L300 175 L360 195 L400 180 L400 500 L0 500Z" fill="#5C3A2F" opacity=".4"/>
              <!-- closer trees -->
              <path d="M0 270 L80 240 L160 265 L240 235 L320 260 L400 245 L400 500 L0 500Z" fill="#3A2515" opacity=".55"/>
              <!-- street -->
<rect x="0" y="380" width="400" height="120" fill="#8B5E47" opacity=".7"/>
              <rect x="0" y="420" width="400" height="3" fill="#D89B2A" opacity=".5"/>
              <!-- runner silhouettes mid -->
              <g fill="#2A1F18" opacity=".82">
                <path d="M120 380 L122 350 L116 330 L122 312 L130 322 L132 350 L136 380Z"/>
                <path d="M180 378 L182 348 L176 328 L182 310 L190 320 L192 348 L196 378Z"/>
                <path d="M240 380 L242 350 L236 330 L242 312 L250 322 L252 350 L256 380Z"/>
                <path d="M300 376 L302 346 L296 326 L302 308 L310 318 L312 346 L316 376Z"/>
              </g>
            </svg>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
